umors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 17 16 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a localizing wire  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm ill defined firm gritty white mass extending through almost the entire length of the specimen and present at the inked margins  A representative section is frozen as frozen section  1  now submitted in cassette A  Note that a portion of the mass is submitted for research  The remainder of the specimen is submitted in its entirety in cassettes B   J  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  BREAST  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA PRESENT AT AN INKED SURFACE  O R  Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
